[02:02:48.480] CORE EXPERIMENT - C objects -> virtual addresses (README 九)
[02:02:48.480] ======================================================================
[02:02:48.480] PIE + ASLR randomize ABSOLUTE addresses, but the relative layout
[02:02:48.480] (text/rodata/data/bss < heap < mmap < stack) is preserved.
